{"metadata":{"ext":[{"Plain":"md"},1],"title":[{"Plain":"单群"},2],"slug":[{"Plain":"单群"},0],"tag":[{"Plain":"百科"},3],"author":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},4]},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<h2>定义</h2>\n<p>在 $\\mathsf{Set}$ 中, 单群是没有非平凡"},{"Local":{"url":"正规子群","text":"正规子群"}},{"Plain":"的群.</p>\n<h2>相关概念</h2>\n<p>"},{"Local":{"url":"有限单群分类","text":"有限单群分类"}},{"Plain":"</p>\n"}]}}